            </div>

        
    </div>

    
</section>
<section class="c-container u-transparent-bg c-container--1000 c-container--center">

    
    <div class="c-container__wrap">

        
                
            <div class="c-container__blocks">
                <div class="o-grid o-grid--large" data-item-count="1">
                                            <div class="o-grid__cell u-1/1@desktop">
    <div class="c-col c-col-text-area c-col--has-bg-color u-white-bg c-content">
                    <h3><strong>How to take part</strong></h3>
<p>This is a free drop in event on <a href="https://www.sadlerswells.com/take-part/the-dance-floor-at-sadlers-wells-east/" rel="noopener">The Dance Floor</a> at <a href="https://www.sadlerswells.com/your-visit/sadlers-wells-east/welcome-to-sadlers-wells-east/" rel="noopener">Sadler’s Wells East</a>.</p>
<p>Participants can take part upon arrival by registering on The Dance Floor.</p>
<p>Slots are every 30 minutes, and up to three people can take place at once. Places are limited and are assigned on a first come first served basis.</p>
<p><strong>Session times:</strong></p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Thursday 5 November</td>
<td>4 pm &#8211; 7.30 pm</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Friday 6 November</td>
<td>4 pm &#8211; 7:30 pm</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Saturday 7 November</td>
<td>2 pm &#8211; 7:30 pm</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
            </div>
</div>
                                    </div>
            </div>

        
    </div>

    
</section>
